# Built under Linux or the template's Docker image: keep LF line ends on
# every checkout (Makefile recipes and shell scripts break with CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary

# The game's data and music, and the tools' programs, byte for byte (some
# X68000 data files are text with CRLF line ends).
game/data/** binary
game/music/** binary
game/sincos.dat binary
tools/bin/** binary
